   "widgets_values": [
    "## Qwen-Image 2.1 \u00b7 Remove Background (uncensored)\nLoad a photo into **image_1** and queue. The model outputs a native **RGBA PNG** (transparent background) at the input's own size (`resolution 0`).\n\n- Want the subject extracted differently? Edit the instruction, e.g. `Extract the person in <image1> and remove everything else, output a PNG image`.\n- Keep **Save \u2192 format png** to preserve the alpha channel.\n- Model switch (yellow, left): false = `UC Q8_0 GGUF`, true = `UC FP8`."
